msgstr ""

#: templates/Scheduling/schedules.html:37
msgid ""
"Nothing is run by a person who may no longer run it: every fire re-reads the"
" owner's role. An owner who loses the required role disables the schedule "
"with the reason stated."
msgstr ""

#: templates/Scheduling/schedules.html:38
